  "chitchat": [
    "\"Best prices in the district. That's not saying much.\"",
    "\"You touch it, you bought it.\"",
    "\"Everything's genuine. Genuinely acquired.\"",
    "\"Trade you for it. Credits preferred. Bullets accepted.\"",
    "\"Limited supply. Always limited. That's the pitch.\"",
    "\"I don't know where it came from. That's not your business either.\"",
    "\"Quality merchandise at prices that won't kill you. Probably.\"",
    "\"Drink's four. The stool's free. The advice is extra.\"",
    "\"That pigeon has been dead longer than you have been drinking. Show some respect.\""
  ],
  "description": "Runs the Dead Pigeon from behind a slab of reclaimed door laid across two oil drums. Pours with the bored precision of somebody who has heard every sob story twice, and the careful blankness of somebody whose till is not the interesting part of the business.",
  "dialogue_tree": {
    "bm_air_already": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 1040,
        "y": 800
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Right.",
          "next": "bm_menu"
        }
      ],
      "text": "\"Already sorted,\" Sully says, not looking up. \"Go fly.\""
    },
    "bm_air_confirmed": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 1040,
        "y": 700
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Good to know.",
          "next": "bm_menu"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Sully writes nothing down, which is how you know it counted. \"Amos Dune, front desk of the Layover, out at the Reach. He doesn't keep stock sitting in the dirt for anyone. You tell him what you want, he has it run out to one of his holes in the ground, and he tells you which one.\" <span class=\"text-dim\">He picks the glass back up.</span> \"Start with the leaf. It's legal, it's dull, and it's how he learns your face.\""
    },
    "bm_air_offer": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 700,
        "y": 700
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "actions": [
            {
              "action": "UNLOCK_AIR_CARGO"
            }
          ],
          "label": "I'm in.",
          "next": "bm_air_confirmed"
        },
        {
          "label": "Not yet.",
          "next": "bm_menu"
        }
      ],
      "text": "You lean in. \"Word is you know someone who flies heavier than a MULE drone, no checkpoint at all.\" Sully studies you a long moment. \"...Maybe. Guy works out of the Reach, way out past the wire. Grows the raw himself and flies it to whoever's got the nerve. Ask for Amos when you're wheels-down at Buzzard Field. You've run clean enough he'll take the meeting.\""
    },
    "bm_menu": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 700,
        "y": 60
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Show me what you've got.",
          "next": "bm_shop"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "bm_trust",
              "op": "gt",
              "scope": "player",
              "value": "9"
            }
          ],
          "label": "You ever move anything... bigger?",
          "next": "bm_air_offer"
        },
        {
          "label": "Not tonight.",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Sully sets down the glass he's been not-cleaning and leans in. \"Back-room list. I don't touch the stuff. I just know a drone pilot who owes me. You point, it lands out at the Scald, and getting it home past the checkpoint is *your* lookout.\""
    },
    "bm_shop": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 1040,
        "y": 60
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "OPEN_SHOP",
          "params": {
            "shelf": "back_room"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [],
      "text": "Sully reaches under the bar and comes up with a battered slate, already scrolling."
    },
    "gossip": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 240
      },
      "actions": [
        {
          "action": "GOSSIP_TELL"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Sully leans in over the bar."
    },
    "menu": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 60
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Back",
          "next": "root"
        }
      ],
      "text": "Swill's free with a straight face. Whiskey'll put hair on parts of you that don't currently have hair. The Glow Cocktail is mostly safe, emphasis on 'mostly,' don't email me about it."
    },
    "root": {
      "_vine": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 60
      },
      "actions": [],
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "What's good?",
          "next": "menu"
        },
        {
          "label": "Heard anything?",
          "next": "gossip"
        },
        {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "flag": "dealer_inner_circle",
              "op": "set",
              "scope": "player"
            }
          ],
          "label": "[quietly] I hear you move more than drinks.",
          "next": "bm_menu"
        },
        {
          "label": "Never mind.",
          "next": ""
        }
      ],
      "text": "Drink or don't, but don't just stand there breathing on my bar."
    }
  },
